prompt_template:
Create one native {ASPECT_RATIO} photographic sports-equipment editorial poster, a modest grainy real-camera photograph with restrained graphic design. {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Fusion: R1 supplies grain and grey editorial spacing, R2 camera ghosts and condensed sans, R3 dark organic mass against pale field, R4 in-scene focus contrast WITHOUT boxes.
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Composition: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Use exactly "{MAIN_TEXT}" as the small charcoal condensed title and "{SECONDARY_TEXT}" as the tiny charcoal category. No other text. About 40% must stay near-empty grey/white, while the active zone has powerful optical blur and crop tension.
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
Natural photography is mandatory: no CG gloss, rim light, HDR, glow, orange streaks, product insets or rectangular frames. Do not make a sample more polished than the references.
